1
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,200
Have all the men been sent out?

2
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:28,200
Yes, they are all skilled fighters,

3
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:30,820
and they are all equipped with poison pills.

4
00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:33,880
There is one more thing I must report to Your Highness.

5
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:39,720
The Right Chancellor sent Su Zhiye to personally receive the Prince of Shuo.

6
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,650
When we make our move, should we...

7
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,960
Calm down, Your Highness.

8
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,880
Previously, Young Master Su visited several times,

9
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,880
but was turned away by Your Highness.

10
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,479
He is just someone Your Highness has no use for.

11
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,960
The Prince of Shuo just picked up a bargain.

12
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:56,880
These ministers claim to be noble and pure,

13
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,940
but in reality, they play both sides.

14
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:02,000
Even if I had accepted Su Zhiye,

15
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,800
the Right Chancellor would still send other nephews

16
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,280
to curry favor with Yuwen Jingxuan.

17
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,840
You are right, Your Highness.

18
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:10,520
Tell those men not to hold back.

19
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:14,320
Once I secure the position of Crown Prince,

20
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:17,060
even the Right Chancellor

21
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:19,920
won't dare to make things difficult for me.

22
00:02:31,640 --> 00:02:34,170
Are these the martial arts experts you found?

23
00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:35,960
They laid an ambush all the way,

24
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,420
but couldn't even take down a single person.

25
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:42,120
Originally, to deal with Su Zhiye and the Prince of Shuo,

26
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:44,040
we prepared plenty of men.

27
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:47,800
But there was also a woman traveling with them.

28
00:02:47,920 --> 00:02:49,120
She is highly skilled,

29
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:50,360
brave, and resourceful.

30
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,620
The ambushes and strategies we designed

31
00:02:52,920 --> 00:02:54,079
were all ruined by her.

32
00:02:54,079 --> 00:02:54,920
A woman?

33
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:58,880
I've never heard that Yunling knows martial arts.

34
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,440
Could it be the Su family again?

35
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:05,520
No, it's the little maid who takes care of the Prince of Shuo at the royal villa.

36
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:08,040
According to the report, the woman is young

37
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,480
and an unfamiliar face.

38
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,880
My good brother

39
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:13,860
is really getting more and more capable.

40
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,800
Should we activate the spies in the Prince's mansion

41
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,460
to find out exactly who she is?

42
00:03:25,160 --> 00:03:26,440
Sixth Brother.

43
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,700
Since you don't know what's good for you,

44
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:31,800
don't blame me for being ruthless.

45
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:39,880
You two,

46
00:03:39,880 --> 00:03:41,680
returning from the palace banquet today,

47
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,140
any interesting stories?

48
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,920
No interesting stories.

49
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:46,680
But

50
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:49,160
when my father wanted to assign me a task today,

51
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:51,200
why did you keep winking at me?

52
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,560
I wanted to advise you

53
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:55,320
never to accept the task of compiling the book.

54
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,600
But you didn't understand,

55
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:57,930
and you readily agreed.

56
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,520
I'm so mad at you.

57
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,450
Compiling a book

58
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,760
doesn't involve court politics

59
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,400
or colluding with outsiders.

60
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:07,060
For Jingxuan, who just returned to the capital,

61
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,240
it's a good thing.

62
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,080
You two don't know.

63
00:04:10,640 --> 00:04:12,920
The compilation of the book has been a mess for months.

64
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:15,980
It's a hot potato that no one in the court dares to touch.

65
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:18,200
How could this be?

66
00:04:19,200 --> 00:04:21,240
Originally, His Majesty instructed the Ministry of Rites,

67
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:23,360
but the officials revered authority,

68
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,400
which angered His Majesty,

69
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:27,280
and he dismissed several high-ranking officials at once.

70
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,880
Before I set out to welcome you,

71
00:04:28,880 --> 00:04:31,560
someone nominated a few highly respected royal family members.

72
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:33,490
They followed His Majesty's lead,

73
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:36,280
but frequently disagreed with the old scholars.

74
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:38,080
So the matter was shelved again.

75
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:41,440
So it's hard for me to maneuver in this matter.

76
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,200
I'll inevitably offend people.

77
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:46,159
If you hadn't returned,

78
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:48,760
this matter would have been left unsettled.

79
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:51,360
I guessed Prince Yu would set a trap for you.

80
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:53,800
I didn't expect that after avoiding the Ministry of Revenue and the Ministry of Rites,

81
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,260
you'd fall into this trap.

82
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,440
Prince Yu?

83
00:04:57,240 --> 00:05:00,120
Is he the Third Prince who was kind to you

84
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,720
and took good care of you when you were young?

85
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:09,000
I didn't expect that we couldn't escape the tragedy of brothers turning against each other.

86
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:12,040
Prince Yu was always the only candidate for the crown prince.

87
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,440
But just as His Majesty decided to appoint a crown prince,

88
00:05:14,440 --> 00:05:16,760
he issued an edict to bring you back to the capital.

89
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:18,820
He definitely wants to strike first.

90
00:05:21,520 --> 00:05:22,320
Alright.

91
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:25,360
Now is not the time to lament your brotherhood.

92
00:05:26,280 --> 00:05:29,200
How should we decline the task of compiling the book?

93
00:05:29,200 --> 00:05:31,040
Miss Tang, do you have any ideas?

94
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:34,640
Why decline?

95
00:05:35,240 --> 00:05:37,300
So everything I just said was in vain?

96
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:44,800
What?

97
00:05:46,080 --> 00:05:47,610
Discussing Confucianism,

98
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:51,120
and setting up a lecture forum outside the palace?

99
00:05:51,880 --> 00:05:54,210
That's what Prince Shuo's memorial said.

100
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,500
Did Father agree to it?

101
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,320
His Majesty hesitated at first.

102
00:05:58,320 --> 00:05:59,450
But Prince Shuo said

103
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:01,800
that the biggest taboo in scholarship is having only one voice.

104
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:04,000
Today's great scholars belong to a hundred schools of thought.

105
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,440
Naturally, a hundred boats should compete,

106
00:06:05,440 --> 00:06:06,520
and a hundred schools of thought should contend,

107
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,160
to be passed down through the ages.

108
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,000
His Majesty was very pleased,

109
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:12,480
and immediately ordered his approval.

110
00:06:13,240 --> 00:06:14,560
I underestimated him.

111
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:18,120
Is there any report from Prince Shuo's mansion?

112
00:06:18,120 --> 00:06:19,760
The day Prince Shuo arrived in the capital,

113
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:21,120
he sent for a doctor.

114
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,960
It is said to treat a woman's injuries.

115
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:26,160
A woman?

116
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,800
They are close.

117
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:31,280
Everyone in the mansion treats her as a master.

118
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:33,120
But right now, we still can't figure out

119
00:06:33,120 --> 00:06:35,600
what her exact relationship with Prince Shuo is.

120
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:39,480
We only know that Su Zhiye calls her Miss Tang.

121
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:42,200
Miss Tang?

122
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:44,600
Reporting to Your Highness,

123
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,930
Lord Shang has arrived.

124
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,780
Uncle, you came in person.

125
00:06:57,840 --> 00:07:00,170
Is there something important to discuss?

126
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:10,760
What?

127
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,560
Emperor's fortune?

128
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:16,380
Since when did Father believe in such illusory things?

129
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:19,650
As long as His Majesty believes it,

130
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:24,440
does it matter if it's true or false?

131
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,730
What was the result of the divination?

132
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,360
In just a few days,

133
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:41,000
he even colluded with the people from Taichang and Taibu.

134
00:07:42,640 --> 00:07:46,280
We have been striving for the Eastern Palace for years.

135
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:50,920
Now we lose to such absurd remarks.

136
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,690
Your Highness can tolerate it,

137
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:58,760
but I cannot accept it.

138
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,140
Your Highness,

139
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:06,200
I have an idea.

140
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:09,360
We can use this to our advantage.

141
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:10,560
Uncle, please speak.

142
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,659
You must keep this from Miss Tang.

143
00:08:35,640 --> 00:08:37,080
The truth will come out.

144
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:41,600
Now there are rumors all over the capital that I am bewitched by a demoness.

145
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:43,059
The situation is chaotic.

146
00:08:43,559 --> 00:08:44,600
After the court session today,

147
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:47,000
Father specially kept me to ask about this.

148
00:08:47,200 --> 00:08:49,060
She will find out sooner or later.

149
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:53,000
I don't know where this evil wind came from.

150
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:55,930
It's probably your kind-hearted third brother.

151
00:08:56,880 --> 00:08:58,200
Targeting women,

152
00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,400
he is really capable.
